{
  "quest.0C35F86DA39D72C6.title": "&9Touching the Void",
  "quest.0C35F86DA39D72C6.quest_subtitle": "The world beneath the bedrock",
  "quest.0C35F86DA39D72C6.quest_desc": [
    "Two ways in:",
    "",
    "&b1.&r Stand on &8exposed bedrock&r at the Overworld's lowest depths for &6several minutes&r until void infusion claims you. This deliberately does &cnot&r work in the &cNether&r or the &dEnd&r.",
    "",
    "&b2.&r Build a &dNether-portal-style&r frame of &9voidic crystal blocks&r and light it with a &7charred bone&r.",
    "",
    "&cWarning:&r gear up first — the &5Void&r is &4lethal&r and its creatures worse.",
  ],
  "task.74DB5F778F913307.title": "Enter the Void",
  "quest.B32D3112FE3B51B4.title": "&5Material Order",
  "quest.B32D3112FE3B51B4.quest_subtitle": "The void provides — at a price",
  "quest.B32D3112FE3B51B4.quest_desc": [
    "Everything the Void offers, it offers at a price. The ladder, in order:",
    "",
    "&bEthereal Essence&r → &9Voidic Crystal&r (ores drop crystals directly) → &7Titanite&r → &cFlesh Ore&r → &5Ichor&r → &aStrange Pearl&r → &dAstral&r.",
    "",
    "&5Paranoia:&r at maximum Paranoia a &cCorrupted Pawn&r spawns — and it takes only &c10% damage&r from non-voidic sources.",
    "",
    "&9Gear augmentation:&r voidic templates with &7titanite&r, &5ichor&r and &dastral&r augments push gear up the tiers. Armor pieces are named &7_chest&r and &7_legs&r.",
  ],
  "task.20D2EBAE5CAF2F79.title": "Ethereal Essence",
  "task.0885E14204AF5B82.title": "Voidic Crystal",
  "task.89079B2C5282A56E.title": "Titanite",
  "task.7D7DDD461E1E6C62.title": "Ichor",
  "task.187B0168E2F12D9A.title": "Strange Pearl",
  "task.8BE8D44D99C70F07.title": "Astral Crystal",
  "quest.41FD3EF40E3A59F9.title": "&cThe Void Fights Back",
  "quest.41FD3EF40E3A59F9.quest_subtitle": "You are not welcome here",
  "quest.41FD3EF40E3A59F9.quest_desc": [
    "&cVoid's Wrath&r roams the deep void, and &5null servants&r (&7titanite&r, &5ichor&r and &dastral&r variants) guard its reaches.",
    "",
    "Wander far enough and the void itself will come to test you.",
  ],
  "task.DE7F60270E64704C.title": "Face the Void's Wrath",
  "quest.AFB763BF70B58482.title": "&5Corrupted Pawn",
  "quest.AFB763BF70B58482.quest_subtitle": "Born of your own paranoia",
  "quest.AFB763BF70B58482.quest_desc": [
    "Spawns when &5Paranoia&r peaks. Only &9voidic damage&r truly hurts it — everything else barely scratches.",
  ],
  "task.077278A217807BE3.title": "Defeat the Corrupted Pawn",
  "quest.30BC4F017D897CEC.title": "&dAstral Regalia",
  "quest.30BC4F017D897CEC.quest_subtitle": "Endgame gear from the void",
  "quest.30BC4F017D897CEC.quest_desc": [
    "The &dAstral set&r is the Void's finest work — &6skill-locked at 45&r in this pack.",
